Nylon-6,6 is synthesised by polycondensation of hexamethylenediamine and adipic acid.

\begin{aligned}
& n \mathrm{HOOC}-\left(\mathrm{CH}_2\right)_4-\mathrm{COOH}+n \mathrm{H}_2 \mathrm{~N}-\left(\mathrm{CH}_2\right)_6-\mathrm{NH}_2 \\
& +\mathrm{CO}-\left(\mathrm{CH}_2\right)_4-\mathrm{CO}-\mathrm{NH}-\left(\mathrm{CH}_2\right)_6-\mathrm{NH}+_n \\
& +(2 n-1) \mathrm{H}_2 \mathrm{O}
\end{aligned}

Number of $-\mathrm{CH}_2$-group is 6 in hexamethylene-diamine and 4 in adipic acid.

The PDI (polydispersity index) $=\frac{M_w}{M_n}=1.67M_w=$ Weight average molecular weight.
$M_n=$ Number average molecular weight.

\begin{aligned}
& M_n=\frac{N_1 M_1+N_2 M_2}{N_1+N_2}=55,000 \\
& M_w=\frac{N_1 M_1^2+N_2 M_2^2}{N_1 M_1+N_2 M_2}=91818
\end{aligned}
